{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to &quot;Cooktopia&quot;!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been chosen to restore taste to Rainbow Island\u2014a world stripped of all flavor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From planting your first seed to cooking wildly imaginative dishes;<br>From reviving community kitchens to hosting legendary feasts;<br>Immerse yourself in farming, fishing, mining, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into quirky minigames, experiment with professions, and rebuild a vibrant utopia bursting with color and hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a game\u2014it\u2019s about connecting hearts through food and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When flavor fades, YOU become the rainbow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore daily surprises, lively festivals, and ever-changing adventures.<br>Open this world with excitement\u2014every moment promises joy and magic!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717010?t=1749495220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3717010?t=1749495220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717010/9636013ce1eeac8b44f97064ab097a3b076579e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749495220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717010/9636013ce1eeac8b44f97064ab097a3b076579e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749495220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_p